          "filename": "Burdaard.JPG",
          "caption": "Burdaard, village on both banks of the Dokkumer Ee in the town of Ferwerderadiel in Fryslân.\nBurdaard has a protected townscape. If we look at the photo we can understand that. It is a pleasant village, mainly due to the many pleasure yachts mooring there for varying periods. \nEven if you don't have a boat, you can go there for a night.\n\nThe sign in the photo with Béd en Brochje cordially invites you.",
          "alt": "Burdaard, village on both banks of the Dokkumer Ee in the town of Ferwerderadiel in Fryslân.\nBurdaard has a protected townscape. If we look at the photo we can understand that. It is a pleasant village, mainly due to the many pleasure yachts mooring there for varying periods. \nEven if you don't have a boat, you can go there for a night.\n\nThe sign in the photo with Béd en Brochje cordially invites you.",
